{"sourceUrl":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/info/1173/27568.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:32.860682+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/info/1173/27568.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>根据教育部相关文件精神和学校《<span>2027</span>年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法》（校研发〔<span>2026</span>〕<span>37</span>号）文件要求，现将人文学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年招收推免研究生复试工作有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p><span>一、招收专业及录取名额</span></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>招收名额</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>055101</span></p></td><td><p><span>英语笔译</span></p></td><td><p><span>5</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>045300</span></p></td><td><p><span>国际中文教育</span></p></td><td><p><span>3</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span>二、申请条件</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>取得本科就读高校的<span>2027</span>年推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>具有过硬的政治素质，社会责任感强，诚实守信，品行优良，积极向上，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>具有较强的创新意识和创新能力，恪守学术道德规范。</span></p><p><span>三、工作程序</span></p><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span>推免系统报名</span></strong></p><p><span>凡有意愿报考我院研究生的推免生，须在</span><span>9</span><span>月<span>21</span>日<span>9</span>：<span>00-18</span>：<span>00</span><span>登录推免服务系统进行注册、并填报志愿，链接：</span></span><span><a href=\"https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span></a></span> <span>。复试通知、待录取通知等会通过推免系统进行发送，请考生及时关注信息。</span></p><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong><strong><span>报名材料提交</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月<span>21</span>日<span>18</span>：<span>00</span>前</span></strong><span>，申请人通过以下链接</span><span><a href=\"https://f.wps.cn/g/5ni6H6AC/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://f.wps.cn/g/5ni6H6AC/</span></a></span> <span>提交报名信息和相关材料。提交材料内容：接收推免报名表（附件<span>1</span>）、由本科在读高校开具的推免资格及排名证明（附件<span>2</span>）、思想品德考核表（附件<span>3</span>）、本科阶段成绩单（加盖教务部门公章）、<span>诚信复试承诺书（附件<span>4</span>）、</span>专业相关的竞赛和学术成果等。同时，以“专业代码<span>-</span>姓名”的实名方式加入<span>QQ</span>群：<span>1121406234</span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong><strong><span>复试安排</span></strong></p><p><span>学院将择优确定复试名单，并于<span>9</span>月<span>22</span>日上午通过推免系统发送复试通知。线下复试时间为<span><span>9</span>月<span>24</span>日上午<span>9</span>：<span>00</span></span>。（具体安排以学院后续通知为准）。考生须按要求缴纳复试费<span>120</span>元。交费网址：</span><span><a href=\"https://op.sicau.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://op.sicau.edu.cn/</span></a></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>复试形式</span></strong><span>：线下面试。考察内容：口头表达能力；专业相关的理论知识；分析问题和解决问题的能力，创新精神、创新能力、科研潜力和科研道德；心理素质等。</span></p><p><span>四、录取</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>复试成绩满分<span>100</span>分，<span>60</span>分及以上者为有效备录人选。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>学院按招生计划、复试录取办法、考生总成绩、思想政治表现、身心健康状况等择优确定拟录取名单，并通过推免系统发送待录取通知。考生登录研招网，在规定时间内接受待录取，完成网上拟录取流程。</span></p><p><span>五、其他事项</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>招收推免生工作全程遵循回避制原则，按照《研究生招生工作回避制度》（校研发〔<span>2026</span>〕<span>38</span>号）（附件7）执行。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>其他事项按照<span>2027</span>年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法（校研发〔<span>2026</span>〕<span>37</span>号）<span>（附件5）</span>及《四川农业大学<span>2027</span>年接收推免研究生（含直博生）工作的通知》</span><span><a href=\"https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm</span></a></span> <span>相关要求执行。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>复试相关事项可咨询人文学院刘老师，电话：<span>0835-2882256</span>，地点：文法楼<span>203</span>。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>本次接收推免生复试工作接受纪委全程监督，纪检监察联系人：陈老师，电话：<span>0835-2882394</span>，邮箱：</span><span>junlinchen@sicau.edu.cn</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>本通知由人文学院负责解释。其他未尽事宜按照教育部要求和学校关于</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推免生工作有关规定执行。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>人文学院</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年<span>9</span>月<span>18</span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"77d94ac947fc18ea257eb6e4df2e317dc1d1fde25b9f3dfa0065c1c500d2802a","textLength":1259,"sourceSha256":"d4091794422bf8c709a28e858cd78842bcb88c17acec3bfaaf225e188b7c6045","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 四川农业大学人文学院2027年招收推免研究生报名表.doc","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=E3C444050BF71BEE6D1EBCBA145E9384"},{"name":"附件2 四川农业大学人文学院学生推免成绩排名及资格证明模板.docx","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=D6651AAD203EDA4BCD89614ABA2CC1FB"},{"name":"附件3 思想政治素质与品德考核表.doc","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=16A839D10A9F24ADE51B0A0400137CBF"},{"name":"附件4 诚信复试承诺书.docx","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=25538CA2D4D4D1C7B8FB792EDE087D02"},{"name":"附件5 2027年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法（校研发【2026】37号）.pdf","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=898C243660DACAF59447C6B01A702622"},{"name":"附件6 四川农业大学研究生招生回避申请表.docx","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=5812C911920799E3F48ABD10EB66316E"},{"name":"附件7 研究生招生工作回避制度-校研发〔2026〕38号.pdf","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=ECD1E9BDC8B449975F7406C552CF1C43"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-52a87d281d714e4640bc","title":"2026年四川农业大学人文学院关于2027年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:32.860682+00:00"}
